  "details": "I have zero idea how this happened, all I did was hide elements and unhide elements of the HUD, enable and disable third person, Pressed F4, and the Menu for Hide Player Nameplate and Hide Desktop HUD got displaced.\n\nAfter a restart, it fixed itself.\n\n(The black arrow represents what where it suppose to be.",
